{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1000_p", "source_sha256": "83888806395c540c198a64cf812ad36841bcd3ce8d95020ef1243c09ead6d182", "ja": "（今日はロコのPV撮影だ。ロコは描きかけの\n大きなキャンバスを現場に持ち込んできた……）", "zh": "（今天是ROCO的PV拍摄。ROCO把一幅尚未完成的巨大画布带到了现场……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "708d0420d5c01eb305f459e9e8c2f1f15889dab90351d3d08543d75a6f1b3459", "ja": "{$P$}！　今日は\nロコのお願いを聞いてくれて、サンクスです！", "zh": "{$P$}！今天能答应ROCO的请求，真是太感谢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1002_025roc", "source_sha256": "a224f341815572fd064348f9a5c3d815674cd976b77e5ad698c0b12dcad41189", "ja": "どうしても今日は、PVの中で、\nこの絵をコンプリートさせたかったので……。", "zh": "今天无论如何都想在PV里完成这幅画……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6bad434de9de67028eefa019c380a563735182e678bd0183e5487538e937fa77", "ja": "ああ、面白い試みだと思ったからな。ちなみにその絵、\nロコにとって大切なものだったりするのか？", "zh": "啊，因为我觉得这是个挺有意思的尝试。顺便问一下，那幅画对ROCO来说，是很重要的东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "f7bdd48dde61c90bd0baa241d57f19095821328dc24c4a77b32f98b9b5b682ba", "ja": "ええと……これは昔、スクールの\nアートルームでドローしていたものなんです。", "zh": "那个……这是以前在学校的美术教室里画的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "6c3ba62acbc73b02e91e3693e835254b2f6c6e0430531a90985b5a52b441bea7", "ja": "フィニッシュできずにしばらくそのままだったん\nですけど、ここで続きを描きたくなりました。", "zh": "虽然没能画完，有一阵子就一直放在那里，不过在这里又想把它继续画下去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8e8ae32ede5f71eddd63db7f8e80b98c53ccfa5e7380d5bd3272b4fb5ce4ec8f", "ja": "なるほど、やり残した仕事って感じか。\nどうしてフィニッシュできなかったんだ？", "zh": "原来如此，感觉就像是留下了没做完的工作啊。\n为什么没能完成呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "39b99c90f482df1db7ed77d2cc34a29a5af5c38a33ff198612f9c2fb79b1ea33", "ja": "完成像がイメージできなかったんです。\n何かが足りない、って思ってしまって……。", "zh": "因为我想象不出它完成后的模样。\n总觉得还缺少了什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "b9bc479585c32c3b54293a3d75226a2170e1359cbdee56f3373c32e73ef938e4", "ja": "アートルームの片隅で、ずっと考えていても……。\n仕上げをどうしたらいいか思いつかなかったんです。", "zh": "即使一直在美术室的角落里思考……也没能想到该如何收尾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "e48d9f675a9c51b9f710cc2b69d614bf8566cf15998b766c2e22ac7a3a7de421", "ja": "窓辺のハトたちを見ながら色々考えたんですけど、\nいいアンサーを見つけられませんでした。", "zh": "我一边看着窗边的鸽子，一边想了很多，可还是没能找到一个好的答案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a84b6ef359f5aa434eeb142dd92c7c3a58c4b9c2abe2d984aa7ff7a67c1ab186", "ja": "ふむ。じゃあ今は、答えが見つかった？", "zh": "嗯。那么现在找到答案了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "dfa81f82df12a539660c952d5adf0d6b32d0384f63957b2a13bff4137f27007b", "ja": "はい！　あくまで今のロコにとっての\nアンサーですけど……イメージができたんです。", "zh": "是的！虽然这只是现在的ROCO的答案……但我已经有了具体的构想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "f11a03febc228afb9b28bd0d8d87f51d378f74674671e53f2226126f4c9eb259", "ja": "ふさわしいカラーを探して、イメージを形に……\nしっかり、エクスプレッションしたいと思います！", "zh": "寻找适合的色彩，将脑海中的形象具现出来……\n我想好好地表现出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9b647b89bf05b8bd919e309cd807d41417572e1d8801b9b80a881f6a00e65813", "ja": "それはよかった。絵の完成が楽しみだ。", "zh": "那太好了。我很期待这幅画完成。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "cb1601a75cd24ce2ca8b094f94b172ed8ace0ba847b647690b55566ed1e61dcf", "ja": "ふふ♪　アンサーをイメージできるようになったのは、\n{$P$}のおかげでもありますよ。", "zh": "呵呵♪能想象出答案，也多亏了{$P$}呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ea2540fedbc41dbaebdbf8f63766a6762a7baaeb895f1548a0486a8c946ce069", "ja": "俺の？", "zh": "托我的福？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1016_025roc", "source_sha256": "db20581f5687b4062f8e1a7de01721c8922edcc33c0534573ede0f8ce88a77b8", "ja": "そうです！　{$P$}が、\nロコをアイドルにしてくれたから。", "zh": "没错！因为是{$P$}先生，把ROCO变成了偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1017_025roc", "source_sha256": "b58333402254f5af403f5ad8efa5f91112ad636b5fc5e96ac3cf166300c603a8", "ja": "アイドルになって、劇場のみんなと出会って、\nみんなの違うワールドやカラーに触れて……。", "zh": "成为偶像后，我遇见了剧场里的大家，也接触到了大家各自不同的世界和风格……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1018_025roc", "source_sha256": "c5804c11c884653a5600e0e229776707c0f686ff5d1c7781d1a53d72ab03f5b3", "ja": "だからロコはエクスペリエンスを重ねることが\nできて……ロコのワールドも広がったんです！", "zh": "所以，ROCO能够不断积累经验……ROCO的世界也变得更加广阔了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1019_p", "source_sha256": "806158e618409d51d43545c22ae54e9ebf4cfed6033f69cceb931cb500f3d51e", "ja": "アイドルとしての経験が、\nアーティストのロコを成長させたって事だな。", "zh": "作为偶像积累的经验，让艺术家的ROCO得到了成长啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "0b1ae4688b8941a2d4d3eb3905d33acb5967af1cc3ffffcf878df75e5b50925e", "ja": "イグザクトリーです！　ロコはまだまだ成長しますよ♪\nもっとクリエイティブに！　もっとカラフルに！", "zh": "完全正确！ROCO还会不断成长哦♪\n变得更有创意！变得更加多彩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1021_025roc", "source_sha256": "af54e4fd729144e783962efae44ea4834fe3a88546e10247b3f5e2f40d711d47", "ja": "{$P$}、これからもロコと一緒に\nいろんなアートをクリエイトしていきましょう！", "zh": "{$P$}，今后也和ROCO一起创作各种各样的艺术吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e33b1b379954cc1550b37b9b49efe1b1ddcc588c48407dd5cbb092fa14348d9b", "ja": "（仕事や出会いを通じて、ロコの世界は\nこれからもどんどん広がっていく事だろう……）", "zh": "（通过工作和相遇，ROCO的世界今后一定还会不断拓展吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0244_1023_p", "source_sha256": "3cf93262b737ae12129527581257151e306a26a4136947b4febfd4381b43b559", "ja": "（アイドルとしても、アーティストとしても、\nその成長から目が離せないな！）", "zh": "（无论作为偶像还是艺术家，都不能移开视线，必须好好关注她的成长啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
